
Terraform:
++++++++++

==> It is infra as code tool which we can use this tool and build the infra on any cloud provider

===> Hashicorp developed the terraform tool

===> .tf is the extension (terraform file)

==> download the binary file and use it and if you want to run the terraform command on anywhere we need to set

environment variable.

==> terraform init --> initialization between your provider(aws) to terraform installed machine

    terraform plan  --> blue print (what we are trying to apply on cloud provider)
 
    terraform apply  --> apply the changes on requested cloud provider
 
    terraform destroy --> termination/deletion of you infra


